\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.poster.avif?t=1773369102\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.webm?t=1773369102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.mp4?t=1773369102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Skill Upgrades: Gain experience through combat and upgrade your hero's skills. Use powerful skills to effectively clear out monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.poster.avif?t=1773369102\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.webm?t=1773369102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135200/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.mp4?t=1773369102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend against incoming monsters. Choose cards to use skills and defeat enemies. Strategic deck-building is the key to victory. Clear each stage and face increasingly powerful monsters, ultimately defeating the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategy and skills. Are you ready to become a brave hero and save the fantasy world?</p>","developers":["Enter the Game Studios"],"dlc":[4032960],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":